    <summary>OpenZaak ZGW API integration for Nextcloud</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[OpenZaak Integration for Nextcloud

Integrate OpenZaak case management (Zaakgericht Werken) APIs with your Nextcloud instance.

- Zaken (cases) management from Nextcloud
- Documenten API integration with Nextcloud Files
- Catalogi and Besluiten API support
- Common Ground / ZGW API compliant
- Free and open source under EUPL

**Requirements:**
- OpenZaak server instance
- Nextcloud 28 or higher
    ]]></description>
